graph TD
    subgraph Frontend [Presentation Layer - Web Browser]
        UI[React NOC Dashboard] <-->|1. WebSockets / REST API| API[API Gateway]
    end

    subgraph Backend [Orchestrator Layer - Node.js Cluster]
        API <--> Cache[(Redis Session Cache)]
        API --> DB[(TimescaleDB Hypertable)]
        
        subgraph Daemon [Telemetry Engine]
            Loop[Collection Daemon] -->|2. Write Snapshots| DB
            Loop -->|3. Trigger Alerts| Mail[SMTP Mail Worker]
            Loop -->|4. Push Task| Queue[RabbitMQ Task Queue]
            LogCollector[Fluentd Log Agent] -->|8. Write Log Aggregation| NAS[(NAS Mount Drives)]
        end
    end

    subgraph Workers [Distributed Scraping Nodes]
        Queue -->|5. Dequeue Task| W[Python Selenium Scrapers]
        W -->|6. Latency Write| DB
    end

    subgraph TargetEnv [DevOps Environment under Observability]
        subgraph Apps [DevOps Applications Layer]
            Bitbucket[Bitbucket API]
            Artifactory[Artifactory API]
            Nexus[Nexus IQ API]
            Fortify[Fortify API]
            TeamCity[TeamCity API]
            ArgoCD[ArgoCD API]
            Sonar[SonarQube API]
            CloudBees[CloudBees Jenkins Controllers]
        end

        subgraph Infra [Infrastructure & Network Layer]
            Avi[Avi Load Balancers]
            SSO[SSO Gateway / LDAP]
            Linux[Linux VM Cluster]
            Windows[Windows VM Cluster]
            DBs[(PostgreSQL Databases)]
            S3[(S3 Storage Buckets)]
        end
    end

    W -.->|Scrape Portal UI| Bitbucket
    W -.->|Scrape Portal UI| Artifactory
    W -.->|Scrape Portal UI| CloudBees

    Loop -->|Query API Telemetry| Apps
    Loop -->|Check Node Metrics & Latencies| Infra
    
    LogCollector -.->|7. Read Log Files| Apps
    LogCollector -.->|7. Read Log Files| Infra

    Trigger[Self-Healing Handler] -->|Trigger Recovery Job| CloudBees
    Trigger -->|Execute Remediation Script| Linux
    Loop --> Trigger

    classDef db fill:#2f3b52,stroke:#1a2333,color:#fff;
    classDef worker fill:#3b5998,stroke:#263a63,color:#fff;
    class DB,Cache,NAS db;
    class W worker;
